---
import Badge from "../ui/Badge.astro";
import GradientText from "../ui/GradientText.astro";
---

<section
  id="problem"
  class="py-24 bg-void border-t border-primary/10 reveal"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <!-- Left: The problem -->
      <div>
        <Badge text="El problema" variant="secondary" />
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-4 mb-6 font-heading leading-tight">
          Tu negocio existe, pero en <GradientText>Google</GradientText> casi no
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-error/10 border border-error/30 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-error"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
              ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"
                /></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-ivory/80 font-mono text-base leading-relaxed">
              Dependés solo de <strong class="text-ivory">redes sociales</strong> que no controlás
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-error/10 border border-error/30 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-error"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
              ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"
                /></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-ivory/80 font-mono text-base leading-relaxed">
              Cuando alguien te busca en Google, <strong class="text-ivory">no aparecés</strong>
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-error/10 border border-error/30 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-error"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
              ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"
                /></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-ivory/80 font-mono text-base leading-relaxed">
              Perdés <strong class="text-ivory">consultas y ventas</strong> que se van a tu competencia
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-error/10 border border-error/30 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-error"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
              ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"
                /></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-ivory/80 font-mono text-base leading-relaxed">
              Sin un sitio web, tu negocio <strong class="text-ivory">parece más chico de lo que es</strong>
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: The bridge -->
      <div
        class="bg-surface rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 p-8 lg:p-10"
      >
        <div
          class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-success/10 border border-success/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-7 h-7 text-success"
            fill="none"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
          ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"
            /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ivory mb-4">
          Un sitio web cambia eso
        </h3>
        <p class="text-muted font-mono leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Rápido, que se vea bien en celular, que aparezca en Google cuando te
          busquen y que convierta visitas en clientes. Sin vueltas, sin
          tecnología que no necesitás.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ivory/60 font-mono text-sm">
          Eso es lo que hago. Y lo que sigue acá abajo es cómo.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40"></span>
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/30"></span>
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/20"></span>
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/10"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
